+   ideal and execute the live-cell witness protocol.
+
+The corrected desk result is stronger than r2 in two respects: `[A^4]Even`
+eliminates `D1` exactly, and the normalized `G=0` analysis closes every
+`deg eta=0` or `s=0` slice while forcing an explicit `deg q` dichotomy in the
