+```text
+-(3aS^4/(2b^2 X Dhi^2))*P,
+```
+
+where
+
+```text
+P=(2e+1)[(2e+1)(2e^2+e+1)-8e^2 sigma].
+```
+
+The inner factor is strictly negative for `sigma>=2e`, `e>=1`. This is the
+second contradiction. Thus the serious degree push proves the whole section
