+| Engine/version and exact field printed | `PASS-SPEC` | executor print required; `QQ` fixed |
+| Protected/colliding identifiers absent | `PASS` | `QQp`, `Kaux`, `R23`, `even_br`, `chiB`, indexed ASCII coefficients |
+| Complete deterministic ring/order declarations | `PASS-SPEC` | `Par_B`, `Build_B`, full generator order; orders must be recorded |
+| Derivative generator tests precede construction | `PASS-SPEC` | four assertions before templates |
+| Every map named, typed, image-tested before use | `PASS` | construction, Rabinowitsch, control, and witness maps named; no inline application |
+| Exact/cap/zero states distinguished | `PASS` | exact `e,g`, honest caps, `-infinity`, optional exact charts |
+| Derived arrays large enough | `PASS` | caps include `deg(Z eta^3)=3e+1`, products, derivatives |
+| Higher `A` templates explicitly zero | `PASS-SPEC` | mandatory assertion in construction step |
+| Denominator-free aliases defined | `PASS` | all three graph identities; no undeclared alias |
+| Correct seven equations encoded | `PASS` | termwise preflight against Section 1 |
+| Corrected top equations retained | `PASS` | landed `A^3/A^4/A^5` graph-basis preflight plus full ideal |
