+| `EMPTY/NONEMPTY` readings scoped correctly | `PASS` | Section 4 protocol and coordinator postcheck |
+
+`PASS-SPEC` means that the assertion is present at the correct point in the
+reference workflow; it is not a claim that a CAS executed it. Execution must
+turn every such row into a logged runtime `PASS`, and any failure aborts the
+box before a mathematical verdict.
+
+FALLACY-v2 audit: derivatives are unambiguous; rings/maps and `sat()` are typed;
+raw degrees branch on zero; finite-box exclusion is not promoted to global
+attainment. The place `{T=0}` is used only as the source divisorial valuation
+defining `alpha,beta`; it remains distinct from the interior `Phi`, target
+places, cover series, flags, carriers, and arrival indices. No pole
+identity, merge descent, exit charge, or boundary-price statement occurs.
+
+## 6. AWS handoff and typed conclusion
+
+Run order is binding:
+
+1. instantiate one box and pass all ring, map, derivative, reconstruction, and
+   corrected-top-coefficient preflights;
+2. pass the finite-jet, complete `(3,1)`, and `F=G=0` controls through the same
+   workflow with their separate rings and open factors;
+3. compute `I_B`, saturation, the Rabinowitsch cross-check, and `NF(1,GBSat_B)`;
+4. log `EMPTY(B)` only as box-local evidence, or stop immediately on a proper
+   ideal and execute the live-cell witness protocol.
+
+The corrected desk result is stronger than r2 in two respects: `[A^4]Even`
+eliminates `D1` exactly, and the degree cascade closes the entire `F=G=0`
+section. It is not a global termination theorem for the remaining `G!=0`
+section.
+
+```text
+OPEN[A2-CELL-32]
+  reduced_model = corrected seven free polynomials / seven residual identities
+  desk_closed    = F=G=0 (all eta,s), after the c5 shear
+  desk_open      = G!=0, hence F=(3a/(2b))eta G!=0
+  next_action    = exact finite boxes under Sections 3-5
+```
+
+No finite box, however large, changes that `OPEN` status without a separate
+global degree-bound theorem. Conversely, one postchecked proper point is a live
+constant-bracket counterexample candidate and must be routed immediately; the
+degree-8 label becomes mathematical only after the field-degree check.
