+rebuilds the other derived data. Use `DeltaFG0=aa*bb*kap*et_e`, with no `G`
+leader. Full coefficient extraction must return `EMPTY`. Reusing live `Delta_B`
+here is forbidden: its `gg_g` factor would make this control tautological.
